# extractor-gemini: extracción de cuestionarios con la Gemini API (free tier). Cada petición consume la cuota diaria gratuita.
# Requiere la extensión REST Client de VS Code (humao.rest-client): clic en "Send Request" sobre cada una.
# Levantar antes el servicio: docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.dev.yml up --build

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070

### Extraer cuestionario: caso 01 (.docx)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/questionnaires/extract
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cuestionario.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ../examples/01-tipo-doc/cuestionario.docx
--boundary--

### Extraer cuestionario: caso 02 (.xlsx, solo la primera hoja)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/questionnaires/extract
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cuestionario.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ../examples/02-tipo-xlsx/cuestionario.xlsx
--boundary--

### Extraer todas las hojas del Excel en paralelo: caso 02 (3 hojas, 3 llamadas a Vertex)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/questionnaires/extract-sheets
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cuestionario.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ../examples/02-tipo-xlsx/cuestionario.xlsx
--boundary--

### Extraer cuestionario: caso 03 (.pdf, se envía directo al modelo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/questionnaires/extract
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cuestionario.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../examples/03-tipo-pdf/cuestionario.pdf
--boundary--
